stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ParseYAML: load_graph_schema()
    ParseYAML --> Validate: GraphValidator::validate()
    Validate --> Build: valid
    Validate --> Failed: invalid

    Build --> Circuit: CircuitRegistry + LinkEngine + TriggerEvaluator
    Circuit --> Components: GraphBuilder builds enabled components
    Components --> Wires: LinkEngine::register_links()
    Wires --> Subscribed: EventBus::subscribe()
    Subscribed --> Active: auto-start components

    state Active {
        [*] --> TickLoop: 100ms tick
        TickLoop --> ProcessAll: Circuit::Tick()
        ProcessAll --> TickLoop

        [*] --> Idle: wait for events
        Idle --> VPNActive: VpnStateChangeEvent
        VPNActive --> Idle: links wired
    }

    Active --> Mutation: IPC graph.components.*
    Mutation --> Persist: atomic YAML write
    Persist --> Active

    Active --> Shutdown: signal
    Shutdown --> StopOrdered: RTSP -> Ext -> Router -> VPN -> Cell
    StopOrdered --> Clear: CircuitRegistry::clear()
    Clear --> [*]
